    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-121621",
      "publishedDate": "2026-11-03T21:00:53.423Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-11-04T16:28:31.860Z",
      "description": "A command injection vulnerability was found in Argo CD Image Updater, where a proxy URL configured on an SSH Git repository is passed unsanitized into a shell-interpreted SSH command. An attacker able to set a malicious proxy value can inject shell metacharacters to execute arbitrary commands and access credentials in the context of the Image Updater process.",
      "severity": 8.8,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Red Hat Red Hat OpenShift GitOps\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-121621",
          "type": "reference"
        },
