    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-120567",
      "publishedDate": "2026-11-03T19:36:46.042Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-11-04T16:30:53.153Z",
      "description": "The MongoDB Entity Framework Core provider does not neutralize special elements in values passed to SetProperty when an ExecuteUpdate call also contains a setter that reads the entity being updated. In that case the update is sent as an aggregation pipeline, and a caller-supplied string beginning with $ is evaluated as an expression rather than stored as data. A party who can influence such a value may modify or remove fields in the records being updated, or copy other fields of the same record into them.",
      "severity": 5.4,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：MongoDB Entity Framework Core Provider\n🔓 漏洞类型：CWE-943 (CWE-943)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
